Desktop.ini

# Deliberately NOT ignored: source, assets/original, data/fictional,
# package.json, package-lock.json, build configs and sanitized env examples.
# Also tracked: README.md, PROJECT_BRIEF.md, AGENTS.md, docs/ and .gitignore.
